charm-onnx
Copyright 2026 Jan Ludwina

This project converts and reimplements parts of Charm
(https://github.com/FBehrad/Charm, https://huggingface.co/FatemehBehrad/Charm),
Copyright Fatemeh Behrad, Tinne Tuytelaars, Johan Wagemans, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes relative to the original:
- src/charm_onnx/tokenizer.py is a NumPy reimplementation of
  Charm_tokenizer.ImageProcessor (Charm-tokenizer 1.0.17).
- src/charm_onnx/export.py rewrites the Charm model forward pass with traceable
  ops and folds DINOv2 LayerScale into the preceding linear layers before ONNX
  export. Exported weights are numerically equivalent to the originals.

The backbone is DINOv2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Test images in tests/images/ are from scikit-image (skimage.data) and are in the
public domain or CC0.
